sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer
    participant Exchange as logs (fanout)
    participant Q1 as queue (consumer1)
    participant Q2 as queue (consumer2)
    participant C1 as Consumer1
    participant C2 as Consumer2
    Producer->>Exchange: publish "log message"
    Exchange->>Q1: forward
    Exchange->>Q2: forward
    Q1->>C1: deliver
    Q2->>C2: deliver
